#: src/components/microservices/MatrixRoadCaster.vue:223
msgid ""
"\n"
"# ML Matrix Road Caster\n"
"  1) Find n zones centroids using a Kmean clustering on the nodes or use "
"your own zoning.\n"
"  2) Call the Google or Here Matrix API on random OD ( around 1% is "
"sufficient )\n"
"  3) Interpolate every other OD time with an hybrid Machine learning model\n"
"  4) ajust the speed on the road network to match the routing time with the "
"OD time using an iterative algorithm') \n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"# ML Matrix Road Caster\n"
"  1)Trouve n centroids de zone avec un Kmean clustering sur les noedsou "
"utiliser votre propre zonage.\n"
"  2) Appel la Google ou la HERE Matrix API sur des OD aléatoires (environs "
"1% est suffisant.)  3) interpolation de toutes les autres OD aveec un model "
"d'apprentissage machine hybride\n"
"  4) Ajuste le temps sur le réseau routier pour correspondre aux temps OD "
"avec une méthode itérative. \n"

